# Mosquitto ACL (issue #43). Everything not granted here is denied; anonymous clients are rejected by mosquitto.conf.
# Contract: api-contract/mqtt-contract.md

# Backend account: subscribes to the three machine channels and never publishes to machine topics.
user fvm-backend
topic read vending/+/telemetry
topic read vending/+/status
topic read vending/+/events

# Machine accounts: username = machine code, so a machine may publish ONLY its own channels
# (FV-DEV-001 -> vending/FV-DEV-001/telemetry|status|events, including its Last Will on status).
# There is no command, dispense, payment or order topic.
pattern write vending/%u/telemetry
pattern write vending/%u/status
pattern write vending/%u/events
